The three authors maintained continuous correspondence during the research process. All critical corrections and diagnostic results were documented in writing---Rastislav Draho\v{s}'s four technical corrections and Marat Sultanov's four TAT blind-test reports were submitted via email or GitHub Issue, and Guanghao Li publicly acknowledged and amended the corresponding conclusions after each correction. This paper faithfully reflects this collaborative process and records each collaborator's specific contributions in the relevant sections.

